[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: Dashboard app requirements
OPTIONS:
  VIEW_STYLE: Table

[GRAMMAR]
IMPORT_FROM_FILE: @requirement

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
Requirements for the wall tablet app in ``dashboard_app/`` (Buddyplan Display). Verifications live in ``docs/verifications/dashboard/``.
<<<

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Setup

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-DSH-010
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Configurable server and login
STATEMENT: >>>
The app shall have no built-in server address; the server URL and the household account are entered in the settings.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: REQ-BE-012

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-DSH-011
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Settings PIN
STATEMENT: >>>
The settings shall optionally be protected with a PIN.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Children use the tablet; settings should stay put.
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-DSH-012
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Expired session
STATEMENT: >>>
When the server rejects the token, the app shall show that the session has expired and keep showing the cached data.
<<<

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Display

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-DSH-020
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Week overview
STATEMENT: >>>
The app shall show a week calendar with a row per person, coloured per person.
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-DSH-021
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Today's tasks
STATEMENT: >>>
The app shall show today's tasks per person, with icon and person colour.
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-DSH-022
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Complete with one tap
STATEMENT: >>>
Tapping an open task shall show it with a 'done' button; confirming shall mark today's occurrence as done. When the server refuses, the app shall show the task as open again and tell the user it could not be completed.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: REQ-BE-032
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: REQ-BE-024

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-DSH-023
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Day detail
STATEMENT: >>>
Tapping a day shall open a day view with the day's events and an analogue clock for timed events. The day view shall close itself after two minutes without interaction.
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-DSH-024
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Week navigation
STATEMENT: >>>
The user shall be able to go to the previous or next week with buttons or by swiping, and back to the current week with one tap.
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-DSH-025
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Per-person visibility and colour
STATEMENT: >>>
The settings shall allow choosing per person whether they are shown and in which colour.
<<<

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Offline

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-DSH-030
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Show last known data
STATEMENT: >>>
Without a connection the app shall keep showing the last data it received, also after a restart of the app or tablet.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: REQ-DSH-005

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Tablet

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-DSH-040
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Always on
STATEMENT: >>>
While the dashboard is shown the screen shall stay on and the app shall run full screen.
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-DSH-041
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Dark mode
STATEMENT: >>>
The app shall offer a dark mode.
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-DSH-042
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Home screen
STATEMENT: >>>
The app shall be selectable as the tablet's home screen (launcher) and offer a list of installed apps to start.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Turns the tablet into a simple kiosk.
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-DSH-043
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Updates from own server
STATEMENT: >>>
The app shall detect a newer display APK on the server and install it after the user confirms.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: REQ-BE-050

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Data refresh

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-DSH-001
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Periodic change check
STATEMENT: >>>
While the dashboard is shown and the server is reachable, the app shall check the server for changes at least once per minute.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The tablet runs for weeks without anyone touching it; it is the family's shared view of the planning.
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-DSH-002
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Show changes without restart
STATEMENT: >>>
When a task or agenda item is added, changed or deleted through the mobile app or the web admin, the dashboard shall show the change at the first change check after it, without a restart or user action.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: REQ-DSH-001
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: REQ-BE-001

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-DSH-003
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Follow the current week
STATEMENT: >>>
When a new week starts while the dashboard shows the current week, the dashboard shall switch to the new current week.
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-DSH-004
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Request size within server limits
STATEMENT: >>>
The app shall request dashboard data in ranges of at most 12 weeks per request, and shall keep a bounded number of cached weeks.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: REQ-BE-002

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-DSH-005
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Visible sync failures
STATEMENT: >>>
When refreshing fails, the app shall keep showing the cached data and shall show the offline indicator.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Stale data must never look up to date.
<<<

[[/SECTION]]
